    <string name="about_title">About SafeScreen</string>
    <string name="about_message">SafeScreen v1.0\n\nBlocking methods:\n• DNS-level blocking via VPN\n• App detection via Accessibility Service\n• PIN-protected settings\n\nBlocked apps:\nYouTube, TikTok, Instagram, Facebook, X (Twitter),\nSnapchat, Twitch, AfreecaTV, Chzzk, Discord,\nReddit, Pinterest, BeReal, KakaoTalk (partial), Browsers</string>

